{"id":"xvkhdeuj1oh2g2swu0jre73pt","title":"如何与服用抗焦虑药物的老人交流？","originalTitle":null,"summary":"84岁脑梗恢复期老人经常头晕，长期服用抗焦虑药物，不愿交流。交流时应避免提问、引导长篇表达，选择低压力话题如感官类、日常琐事，给予充足反应时间，避免评判类话题。适度陪伴和安抚，帮助老人减轻焦虑和头晕症状。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=213646&do=blog&id=1561192"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.424Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.424Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":32,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}